OL,3,GNEWSAMan released without charge after
OL,4,AWaterford attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 20s, who was arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with a suspected arson
OL,8,Fattack which killed four family members
OL,9,Fin the Republic of Ireland, has been
OL,10,Freleased without charge.
OL,12,FPhilip and Kim English and two of their
OL,13,Fchildren - nine-year-old Jayden and
OL,14,F12-year-old Callum - died after their
OL,15,Fhome in Birch Avenue, on the outskirts
OL,16,Fof Waterford, was set on fire earlier
OL,17,Fthis month.
OL,19,FA man aged in his 20s and a woman in
OL,20,Fher 30s were previously charged in
OL,21,Fconnection with the attack.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
