OL,3,GNEWSAMan released without charge after
OL,4,AWaterford attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday, gardai (Irish police) said
OL,7,Fthree people - two women in their 30s
OL,8,Fand a man in his 50s - who were
OL,9,Farrested on Tuesday were released
OL,10,Fwithout charge.
